From: Project Arctic
Subject: wintypes: ApiInformation answers every question, as Windows does.

IsTypePresent, IsApiContractPresent with a minor version and the questions
about members of a type returned E_NOTIMPL. A program written with
C++/WinRT throws on a failed call: Logitech G HUB's agent ended at its start
with an unhandled winrt::hresult_not_implemented. A type is now present when
its class is registered (WindowsRuntime\ActivatableClassId), a contract by
its major version, as before; members cannot be known without the metadata
and are answered as not present, as IsMethodPresent already was, so that a
program takes the path it has for older systems. Verified: the agent runs.
